---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant Registry as External Registry

    Note over Node,Registry: Registry Capabilities Discovery Flow

    Node->>Registry: GET /capabilities
    activate Registry
    Registry-->>Node: 200 OK
    Note right of Registry: {<br/>  "name": "uxpatterns",<br/>  "version": "2025-01-12",<br/>  "capabilities": {<br/>    "taxonomy": true,<br/>    "entities": true,<br/>    "bookmarks": true,<br/>    "weights": true,<br/>    "dataAccess": {<br/>      "localCopy": "index"<br/>    },<br/>    "sync": {<br/>      "enabled": true,<br/>      "mode": "delta"<br/>    }<br/>  }<br/>}
    deactivate Registry

    Node->>Node: Parse capabilities
    Node->>Node: Determine supported features

    alt Supports Taxonomy
        Node->>Registry: GET /taxonomy
        activate Registry
        Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (taxonomy data)
        deactivate Registry
    end

    alt Supports Entities
        Node->>Registry: GET /entities
        activate Registry
        Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (entity definitions)
        deactivate Registry
    end

    alt Supports Bookmarks
        Node->>Registry: GET /bookmarks?limit=10
        activate Registry
        Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (bookmark items)
        deactivate Registry
    end

    alt Supports Weights
        Node->>Registry: GET /weights
        activate Registry
        Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (tag/entity weights)
        deactivate Registry
    end

    Node->>Node: Store registry metadata<br/>and capabilities
```
